---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Ported from alpha-efficiency-2024 template-privacy.blade.php ->
// partials.privacy.{hero-content,wrepper-content}.
//
// The legal copy is transferred verbatim by script rather than retyped, so the
// published wording cannot drift during the migration. Only @asset() paths were
// rewritten.
const bodyHtml = `<div class="hero">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="bgImg"></div>
</div>

<div class="wrepper">
  <div class="text-content">
    <p><strong>Your Privacy is important to us.</strong></p>

    <p>
      To better protect your privacy, we provide this notice explaining our online information practices
      and the choices you can make about the way your information is collected and used. To make this
      notice easy to find, we make it available on our homepage and at every point where personally
      identifiable information may be requested.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Google Adsense and the DoubleClick DART Cookie</strong></p>

    <p>
      Google, as a third-party advertising vendor, may use cookies to serve ads on this site. The use of
      DART cookies by Google enables it to serve advertisements to visitors based on their visits to this
      website and other sites on the internet.
    </p>

    <p>
      To opt out of DART cookies, you may visit Google’s ad and content network privacy policy at:
      <a href="http://www.google.com/privacy_ads.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        http://www.google.com/privacy_ads.html
      </a>.
      Tracking of users through the DART cookie mechanisms is subject to Google’s own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <p>
      Other third-party ad servers or ad networks may also use cookies to track users’ activities on this
      website to measure advertisement effectiveness and for other reasons that will be provided in their
      own privacy policies. Alpha Efficiency has no access to or control over these cookies that may be
      used by third-party advertisers.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Collection of Personal Information</strong></p>

    <p>
      When visiting Alpha Efficiency, the IP address used to access the site may be logged along with the
      dates and times of access. This information is used to analyze trends, administer the site, track user
      movement, and gather broad demographic information for internal use. Most importantly, any recorded
      IP addresses are not linked to personally identifiable information.
    </p>

    <p>
      We may also collect personal information that you voluntarily provide through website forms, contact
      requests, consultations, newsletter sign-ups, or other communications with us. This information may
      include your name, email address, phone number, company information, and any other details you
      choose to provide.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Use of Personal Information</strong></p>

    <p>
      The information you provide may be used to respond to inquiries, provide information about our
      services, communicate regarding pricing, project details, or support requests, improve our website,
      services, and customer experience, and send follow-up communications related to your inquiry or request.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>SMS Communications</strong></p>

    <p>
      If you provide your phone number through our website or other communication channels, Alpha Efficiency
      may send you text messages related to your inquiry, requested services, updates, scheduling, pricing,
      or other service-related communications.
    </p>

    <p>
      Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties, excluding
      aggregators and providers of the text messaging services necessary to deliver these communications.
    </p>

    <p>
      Mobile phone information is stored securely and will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for
      marketing or promotional purposes.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Links to Third-Party Websites</strong></p>

    <p>
      We have included links on this site for your use and reference. We are not responsible for the privacy
      policies on these websites. You should be aware that the privacy policies of these sites may differ
      from our own.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Changes to this Privacy Statement</strong></p>

    <p>
      The contents of this statement may be altered at any time, at our discretion. Any updates will be
      posted on this page.
    </p>

    <br>

    <p><strong>Contact Information</strong></p>

    <p>
      If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact us at
      <i>
        <a href="mailto:bojan@alphaefficiency.com">bojan@alphaefficiency.com</a>
      </i>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>`;
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Alpha Efficiency"
  description="How Alpha Efficiency collects, uses and protects your information."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  type="website"
  fullBleed={true}
  bodyClass="page-template page-template-template-privacy template-privacy page"
>
  <Fragment set:html={bodyHtml} />
</Base>
